    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc403b6bc59877356978077",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……法国远征啊。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3720111f79a270204c23e1895bf31bf4abb39ee2c51ec290694d92dea34f2bac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c3a38fc110443dfabbc7fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但之后的远征与其跟生蚝决胜负，\n还是会以比赛的对决为优先。\n就算到了法国应该也没机会吃生蚝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f18cca8675c2eb8d2bf6bde8df85b60d94f58403f40bfbbc9cdf4680534b4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afeef3a8a497764eacfb3ad0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我在想别的事",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cfbe15a96471bf9db25276070ab083ad9af5af2b662fd093db94705a05c2b1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
